    "title": "Milwaukee weather: Warming up on Thursday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 hours ago Clear skies and comfortable overnight. Temperatures settling in the low 60s by sunrise. Mostly sunny and warm on Thursday. Wildfire smoke will return to our skies as well. Highs in the upper 80s with dew points in the low 60s. Showers and non-severe t-storms return on Friday afternoon into Friday night. Highs in the upper 70s on Friday. Lingering rain showers are possible on Saturday with highs in the mid-70s. Read full article",
